WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
The Pot and Pour logo and tagline appear on a clean white background.

00:05.000 --> 00:15.000
A tin of Japanese matcha powder is shown, followed by whisking matcha powder with hot water in a bowl.

00:15.000 --> 00:24.000
A close-up view of various small indoor succulent plants in pots.

00:24.000 --> 00:34.000
Whisking matcha again, then pouring milk over ice in a glass and adding the green matcha mixture.

00:34.000 --> 00:44.000
An espresso machine in action at the cafe counter, followed by shots of Angeles, Pampanga street view and buildings.

00:44.000 --> 00:55.000
Closing screen displaying "Come visit us! Pot and Pour" with logo and tagline.